# The Full Record — API keys for live data ingestion.
# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in. All are free.

# NY State OpenLegislation API — NY Senate + Assembly bills, floor votes, members.
# Get one: https://legislation.nysenate.gov/ -> "Get API Key" (emailed instantly).
NY_OPENLEG_API_KEY=

# congress.gov API (a data.gov key) — bill titles, official summaries, member data.
# Get one: https://api.congress.gov/sign-up/ (emailed instantly).
CONGRESS_GOV_API_KEY=

# OPTIONAL — NYC Geoclient API for authoritative council-district lookup.
# Without it we use the (keyless) Census geocoder + NYC ArcGIS point query.
# Get one: https://api-portal.nyc.gov -> sign up -> subscribe to "Geoclient API".
NYC_GEOCLIENT_KEY=

# OPTIONAL — Anthropic API key, used at ingest time to write the plain-English
# "AI summary" line for each bill (the UI already labels them as AI-generated).
# Without it, summaries fall back to the official CRS/memo text.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
